    "detailed_description": "Legend of Parry King is an action-packed boss-rush game inspired by the combat of Sekiro. Explore the beautiful eastern lands and face off against corrupted demons, defeating them through skillful parrying and dodging, without causing them harm.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3116540/extras/56e7770f3321f1749b8523f75a1cc11d.poster.avif?t=1739983111\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3116540/extras/56e7770f3321f1749b8523f75a1cc11d.webm?t=1739983111\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3116540/extras/56e7770f3321f1749b8523f75a1cc11d.mp4?t=1739983111\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Step into the shoes of a true parry master in The Legend of Parry King, where winning isn\u2019t about inflicting harm, but outmaneuvering your opponent.<br><br><strong>Gameplay Highlights:</strong><br><br><strong>Dispel the Demon Mist:</strong><br>Every successful parry or dodge reduces the &quot;demon power&quot; of your opponent. Reduce it to zero, and they will no longer be aggressive.<br><br><strong>Harm No One:</strong><br>Travel through the beautiful landscapes of the East, subduing rampaging demons along the way without harming them, to stop the Attack Demon, spreading its deadly poison across the land.<br><br><strong>The Art of Parrying:</strong><br>Demons have a variety of attacks. To dodge correctly, you must recognize the attack patterns and how to parry or dodge them. Timing and reflexes are essential!<br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3116540/extras/44f733402f44f4b7d2ffe15c45d8a2b2.poster.avif?t=1739983111\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3116540/extras/44f733402f44f4b7d2ffe15c45d8a2b2.webm?t=1739983111\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3116540/extras/44f733402f44f4b7d2ffe15c45d8a2b2.mp4?t=1739983111\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Become a legend by mastering these moves and neutralizing your foes with finesse in <strong>Legend of Parry King!</strong>",
    "about_the_game": "Legend of Parry King is an action-packed boss-rush game inspired by the combat of Sekiro. Explore the beautiful eastern lands and face off against corrupted demons, defeating them through skillful parrying and dodging, without causing them harm.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3116540/extras/56e7770f3321f1749b8523f75a1cc11d.poster.avif?t=1739983111\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3116540/extras/56e7770f3321f1749b8523f75a1cc11d.webm?t=1739983111\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3116540/extras/56e7770f3321f1749b8523f75a1cc11d.mp4?t=1739983111\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Step into the shoes of a true parry master in The Legend of Parry King, where winning isn\u2019t about inflicting harm, but outmaneuvering your opponent.<br><br><strong>Gameplay Highlights:</strong><br><br><strong>Dispel the Demon Mist:</strong><br>Every successful parry or dodge reduces the &quot;demon power&quot; of your opponent. Reduce it to zero, and they will no longer be aggressive.<br><br><strong>Harm No One:</strong><br>Travel through the beautiful landscapes of the East, subduing rampaging demons along the way without harming them, to stop the Attack Demon, spreading its deadly poison across the land.<br><br><strong>The Art of Parrying:</strong><br>Demons have a variety of attacks. To dodge correctly, you must recognize the attack patterns and how to parry or dodge them. Timing and reflexes are essential!<br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3116540/extras/44f733402f44f4b7d2ffe15c45d8a2b2.poster.avif?t=1739983111\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3116540/extras/44f733402f44f4b7d2ffe15c45d8a2b2.webm?t=1739983111\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3116540/extras/44f733402f44f4b7d2ffe15c45d8a2b2.mp4?t=1739983111\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Become a legend by mastering these moves and neutralizing your foes with finesse in <strong>Legend of Parry King!</strong>",
